n the same day, and we aim to resolve issues within 3 working days.",q:"Do you offer any support?"},{a:"Yes. Please get in touch to discuss our Business or Enterprise plans",q:"Do you offer Service Level Agreements / guarantees for uptime and screenshot processing time?"},{a:"We primarily serve revenue generating businesses ranging from single freelancers, bloggers and startups all the way to established businesses and enterprises. These customers depend on us to continue operating sustainably as we have done for over a decade.",q:"Why don't you offer a free plan?"},{a:"We've worked to make our plans as affordable as possible while keeping our business sustainable. The annual Lo-Fi plan works out at just over $4/month. If that doesn't work for you, please get in touch to tell us about your project. We'll see if we can work something out.",q:"I really want to use you guys, but I just can't afford the service right now!"},{a:"We use Google Cloud Storage to store screenshot images. If you're on the Hi-Fi plan or above, you can choose to save screenshots to your own Amazon S3 bucket. The Ultra plan and above supports any S3-compatible storage provider.",q:"Where do screenshots get stored?"},{a:"We will work with you to ensure our product meets your needs. Please help us make it better by letting us know what we can do to improve. If you're still not satisfied after 30 days you can have your money back.",q:"Your service sucks - I want my money back!"},{a:"It's easy to cancel - just log in to the dashboard to cancel your subscription. Your account will remain active until your renewal date, and after that you will no longer be charged.",q:"How do I cancel my subscription?"}];function openCrisp(){$crisp.push(["do","chat:open"])}__turbopack_context__.s(["FAQ",0,()=>(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.jsxs)("section",{className:"mx-auto w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-24 2xl:px-0",children:[(0,__TURBOPACK__imported__module__391398__.js